| --- | --- | --- |
| <span lang="ja">応答性</span><span lang="en">Responsive</span> | <span lang="ja">計算と待機・作用を分離</span><span lang="en">Separate calculation from waiting/effects</span> | <span lang="ja">Job受付、期限、同時実行制限</span><span lang="en">Job acceptance, deadlines, concurrency limits</span> |
