# Tracing Model-to-Execution Connections through Quotation Confirmation｜見積りの確定でモデルと実行の接続を確認する

<span lang="ja">数量と通貨を独立に検査し、検査済みの値を見積計算へ渡します。価格表と規則の版を入力に含め、純粋計算で金額と更新候補を得ます。Consequenceが成功した値だけを保存操作へ接続し、Free Monadによるプログラムとしてインタープリタへ渡します。</span><span lang="en">Quantity and currency are validated independently, then validated values enter the quotation calculation. A price snapshot and rule version are explicit inputs to the pure computation of an amount and proposed update. Only successful Consequence values connect to persistence operations in a Free Monad program passed to the interpreter.</span>

<span lang="ja">実行側は認可と必要な競合条件を確認し、UoWで更新を確定します。更新後の通知やViewへの反映は、選択した配信・投影経路へつなぎます。図は成功時の役割の接続を示します。入力不正、業務条件不成立、保存時競合では、止まる位置と返す結果が異なります。</span><span lang="en">Execution checks authorization and required concurrency conditions and commits updates through UoW. Notifications and View updates follow the selected delivery and projection path. The diagram traces responsibilities on success. Invalid inputs, rejected business conditions and storage conflicts stop at different boundaries and return different outcomes.</span>

<span lang="ja">[[images/quotation-execution-ja.png]]</span><span lang="en">[[images/quotation-execution-en.png]]</span>

<span lang="ja">成功時の例：計算、操作記述、解釈、確定を分担する</span><span lang="en">Success path: separate calculation, program construction, interpretation and commitment</span>

