## CNCF Types and Execution APIs｜CNCFの型と実行APIの対応

<span lang="ja">以下はCNCFのkernel.scala、unitofwork/types.scala、UnitOfWorkInterpreterとsimplemodeling-libのConsequence・ConsequenceTの対応です。現在のCNCFのFree実装はCatsのFreeを使用します。書籍で使われるScalazとの共通点は抽象化の考え方にあり、ライブラリやAPIの同一性を前提にしません。</span><span lang="en">The following maps CNCF kernel.scala, unitofwork/types.scala and UnitOfWorkInterpreter to simplemodeling-lib Consequence and ConsequenceT. Current CNCF uses Cats Free. The connection to the book’s Scalaz examples is conceptual, not an assumption of identical libraries or APIs.</span>

#+CAPTION: <span lang="ja">役割とCNCFの実装名</span><span lang="en">Responsibilities and CNCF implementation names</span>
| <span lang="ja">役割</span><span lang="en">Role</span> | <span lang="ja">実装名・型</span><span lang="en">Implementation / type</span> | <span lang="ja">保持または実行するもの</span><span lang="en">Represents or executes</span> |
| --- | --- | --- |
| <span lang="ja">処理結果</span><span lang="en">Computation outcome</span> | <span lang="ja">`Consequence[A]`</span><span lang="en">`Consequence[A]`</span> | <span lang="ja">SuccessのA / FailureのConclusion</span><span lang="en">Success A or Failure Conclusion</span> |
| <span lang="ja">構造化した失敗</span><span lang="en">Structured failure</span> | <span lang="ja">Conclusion</span><span lang="en">Conclusion</span> | <span lang="ja">観測・解釈・対処・状態・原因</span><span lang="en">Observation, interpretation, disposition, status, causes</span> |
| <span lang="ja">一つの型付き操作</span><span lang="en">One typed operation</span> | <span lang="ja">`UnitOfWorkOp[A]`</span><span lang="en">`UnitOfWorkOp[A]`</span> | <span lang="ja">操作の引数と結果型</span><span lang="en">Operation arguments and result type</span> |
| <span lang="ja">操作を合成した記述</span><span lang="en">Composed operation description</span> | <span lang="ja">`Program[F, A]` = `Free[F, A]`</span><span lang="en">`Program[F, A]` = `Free[F, A]`</span> | <span lang="ja">操作Fからなるプログラム</span><span lang="en">Program made of operations F</span> |
| <span lang="ja">記述と結果の組合せ</span><span lang="en">Description plus outcome</span> | <span lang="ja">`UowM[F, A]`</span><span lang="en">`UowM[F, A]`</span> | <span lang="ja">ConsequenceTでProgramと結果を合成</span><span lang="en">ConsequenceT combines Program and outcome</span> |
| <span lang="ja">CNCFの操作へ固定した型</span><span lang="en">Concrete CNCF vocabulary</span> | <span lang="ja">`ExecProgram[A]` / `ExecUowM[A]`</span><span lang="en">`ExecProgram[A]` / `ExecUowM[A]`</span> | <span lang="ja">FをUnitOfWorkOpへ具体化</span><span lang="en">F specialized to UnitOfWorkOp</span> |
| <span lang="ja">解釈と終了の管理</span><span lang="en">Interpretation and termination</span> | <span lang="ja">UnitOfWorkInterpreter / UnitOfWork</span><span lang="en">UnitOfWorkInterpreter / UnitOfWork</span> | <span lang="ja">操作実行、確定・中止、資源解放</span><span lang="en">Operations, commit/abort and cleanup</span> |

## Supporting and Internal Sources｜補助資料と内部資料

<span lang="ja">公開補助資料：CatsのFree Monad解説（https://typelevel.org/cats/datatypes/freemonad.html）、リアクティブ宣言（https://www.reactivemanifesto.org/）。書籍の紹介・公開目次・公開抜粋で確認できる範囲と、製品固有の実装上の説明を区別して参照しています。</span><span lang="en">Public supporting sources: Cats Free Monad documentation (https://typelevel.org/cats/datatypes/freemonad.html) and the Reactive Manifesto (https://www.reactivemanifesto.org/). References distinguish material verified through public descriptions, contents and excerpts from product-specific implementation evidence.</span>

<span lang="ja">内部資料：SimpleModeling.org「プログラミング・ハーネス」第6回のCoreと日英本文。Textus技術文書のDDDモデリング技術ガイド、リアクティブ技術ガイド。前者から型・Consequence・Free Monad・UoWの役割分担を引き継ぎ、モデリングから実行への説明として再構成しています。</span><span lang="en">Internal sources: the Core and bilingual manuscript of SimpleModeling.org’s sixth harness article, Programming Harness; the DDD Modeling and Reactive technical guides. The harness article’s roles for types, Consequence, Free Monad and UoW are reorganized here around model-to-execution continuity.</span>

<span lang="ja">内部の設計・実装資料：CNCF docs/rules/consequence.md、docs/design/free-unitofwork-execution-model.md、docs/design/unitofwork-program-planning.md、docs/design/unit-of-work-resource-lifecycle.md。実装はorg.goldenport.cncf配下のkernel.scala、unitofwork/types.scala、UnitOfWorkOp.scala、UnitOfWorkInterpreter.scalaと、simplemodeling-libのorg.goldenport配下のConsequence.scala、Conclusion.scala、ConsequenceT.scala。計画・記録契約の設計範囲と、実行APIとして確認した動作を区別しています。</span><span lang="en">Internal design and implementation sources: CNCF docs/rules/consequence.md, docs/design/free-unitofwork-execution-model.md, docs/design/unitofwork-program-planning.md and docs/design/unit-of-work-resource-lifecycle.md; org.goldenport.cncf kernel.scala and unitofwork/types.scala, UnitOfWorkOp.scala and UnitOfWorkInterpreter.scala; simplemodeling-lib org.goldenport Consequence.scala, Conclusion.scala and ConsequenceT.scala. Planning/recording design scope is distinguished from behavior established by execution API implementations.</span>
